    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm a bit worried that calling it \"manageable\" might backfire if they find out the challenge is actually serious enough to invalidate the whole thing. If we tell them it's just a minor risk and then it falls through during the merger, we could be looking at a massive lawsuit for fraud. Is there a way to frame this so we don't have to admit there's a real chance of losing the patent entirely?",
